   "t": "We deliver for today’s battlefield, and build for tomorrow’s resilience. | A solution built for military operators,  | strengthened by Purposeful Intelligence in every mission. | Unified through Nexus | With Nexus - our platform-agnostic C2 software - we unify the fragmented landscape of unmanned defense systems, so that industry leaders unlock new capabilities. | DISCOVER NEXUS | Join Intelic BASE | We power the European procurement hub for interoperable defense systems. Source, compare and procure mission-ready unmanned systems, ready to deploy. | GAIN ACCESS NOW"
