   "n": "Hero Content Text Block",
   "t": "We deliver for today’s battlefield, and build for tomorrow’s resilience. | A solution built for military operators,  | strengthened by Purposeful Intelligence in every mission. | Unified through Nexus | With Nexus - our platform-agnostic C2 software - we unify the fragmented landscape of unmanned defense systems, so that industry leaders unlock new capabilities. | DISCOVER NEXUS | Join Intelic BASE | We power the European procurement hub for interoperable defense systems. Source, compare and procure mission-ready unmanned systems, ready to deploy. | GAIN ACCESS NOW"
  },
  {
   "n": "the challenge / solution",
   "t": "THE CHALLENGE | A fragmented landscape of unmanned systems undermines operational speed, coordination and control, leaving military forces vulnerable in contested environments. | THE SOLUTION | Nexus is the advanced military Command-and-Control software for unmanned systems. Platform-agnostic by design, Nexus ensures interoperability between multiple unmanned systems, operators and commanders, and Battlefield Management Systems."
  },
  {
   "n": "meet nexus",
   "t": "PRODUCT | Meet Nexus | Turn your unmanned system into the most capable asset on the battlefield | DISCOVER NEXUS | Explore features | Our product in short | Nexus bridges the gap between ground control stations and Battle Management Systems, providing full control up to the command of multiple unmanned systems. With built-in onboard intelligent functions, the software is designed for military use in contested environments. | Used by industry leaders in Europe | Across Europe, defense systems often struggle to work together. Nexus changes that by bridging gaps between manufacturers and nations, transforming fragmentation into collaboration. | Partner with us"
  },
  {
   "n": "Introduction mission profiles",
   "t": "SCREEN | SUPPLY | ATTACK | Screen | From fast planning to a common picture with a wide range of systems | DISCOVER MISSION TYPE | F.01 | Many-to-many mission control | F.02 | Battlefield integrations | F.03 | Powerful onboard AI | F.04 | Military user interface"
  },
  {
   "n": "SCREEN",
   "t": "SCREEN | SUPPLY | ATTACK | Screen | From fast planning to a common picture with a wide range of systems | DISCOVER MISSION TYPE | F.01 | Many-to-many mission control | F.02 | Battlefield integrations | F.03 | Powerful onboard AI | F.04 | Military user interface"
  },
  {
   "n": "SCREEN",
   "t": ""
