  {
   "n": "About us introduction",
   "t": "OUR COMMITMENT | We are building | a stronger Europe | Europe is facing increasing threats. While we do not seek conflict, we must be prepared to respond when necessary. With military forces experiencing personnel shortages and limited readiness for prolonged operations, unmanned systems are essential in bridging gaps and maintaining the upper hand. | True strategic advantage is realized through the seamless and effective operation of these unmanned systems. We reduce integration and deployment times, compress operator training thanks to intuitive tools, leverage smart functions that empower immediate action, and lay the foundation for coalition readiness. Together, these capabilities serve to strengthen the forces protecting Europe. | ABOUT US"
  },
  {
   "n": "Image",
   "t": "OUR COMMITMENT | We are building | a stronger Europe | Europe is facing increasing threats. While we do not seek conflict, we must be prepared to respond when necessary. With military forces experiencing personnel shortages and limited readiness for prolonged operations, unmanned systems are essential in bridging gaps and maintaining the upper hand. | True strategic advantage is realized through the seamless and effective operation of these unmanned systems. We reduce integration and deployment times, compress operator training thanks to intuitive tools, leverage smart functions that empower immediate action, and lay the foundation for coalition readiness. Together, these capabilities serve to strengthen the forces protecting Europe. | ABOUT US"
